WEBVTT

00:15.932 --> 00:17.934
[opening theme music playing]

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:45.962 --> 00:49.340
I often imagined myself standing alone
on top of a very tall tree.

00:50.383 --> 00:54.095
I knew no one
and I felt so helpless with no one around.

00:56.222 --> 00:58.183
I was hoping
someone would come and rescue me.

01:00.727 --> 01:01.770
And then you came.

01:03.688 --> 01:04.606
What…

01:06.649 --> 01:07.734
What are you talking about?

01:09.569 --> 01:11.571
It's just my fantasy.

01:13.615 --> 01:16.284
I told you there was something
I kept thinking about in that room.

01:17.452 --> 01:19.329
I promise you I don't have that stone!

01:24.292 --> 01:26.294
[pensive music playing]

01:38.348 --> 01:39.349
I must have…

01:42.268 --> 01:43.520
gone crazy because of you.

01:48.817 --> 01:50.235
Why do you keep confusing me?

01:51.402 --> 01:52.654
Why are you so confused?

01:53.780 --> 01:55.657
You hold my hand and listen to my stories…

01:56.950 --> 01:58.451
only to think about someone else.

02:00.829 --> 02:04.415
If you miss her so much you think
you'll go crazy, let me help you more.

02:04.499 --> 02:06.543
Should I just do everything
she once did for you?

02:06.626 --> 02:08.086
Well, since you are so mad--

02:08.169 --> 02:10.088
A tree like that actually exists.

02:12.132 --> 02:13.883
A very big, tall tree.

02:13.967 --> 02:16.261
There really is a tree
that we had promised…

02:17.846 --> 02:18.805
to climb together.

02:19.848 --> 02:21.141
You mean in Danhyanggok?

02:24.352 --> 02:27.772
Uh, that's right?
Oh, I wonder how I know that.

02:29.023 --> 02:30.859
Maybe I went there once.

02:33.027 --> 02:35.113
This is why I have problems
believing to your stories.

02:37.782 --> 02:39.367
Believe it if you want, okay?

02:40.285 --> 02:42.078
Regardless, this hand is mine.

02:42.871 --> 02:46.332
If I hold you or rock you to sleep,
that's me, all right?

02:46.916 --> 02:47.750
So…

02:48.334 --> 02:50.837
when you're looking at me like this,
see me for who I am…

02:52.755 --> 02:53.965
like that night.

02:57.051 --> 02:58.511
I'm not dreaming anymore.

02:59.095 --> 03:00.930
- Do you know who I am then?
- Yeah.

03:02.307 --> 03:03.349
You're the one who woke me up.

03:06.477 --> 03:07.937
[ominous stinger]

03:08.521 --> 03:09.898
Someone just entered from over there.

03:12.066 --> 03:13.526
I can see their energy

03:14.611 --> 03:15.862
behind that tree there.

03:15.945 --> 03:18.031
[suspenseful music playing]

03:18.948 --> 03:22.035
But I think
the energy belongs to someone I know.

03:22.118 --> 03:24.329
Who? Someone from Jinyowon?

03:25.079 --> 03:25.914
Ah, no.

03:27.290 --> 03:28.416
It's your friend, Jang Uk.

03:37.216 --> 03:38.217
Seo Yul?

03:38.843 --> 03:39.677
Jang Uk?

03:44.933 --> 03:46.309
It really is you.

03:48.436 --> 03:50.480
I was wondering.
She said she could see you.

03:50.563 --> 03:51.814
What are you doing here?

03:51.898 --> 03:53.691
I'm here
because I have to look for someone.

03:54.192 --> 03:56.402
[breathing shakily]

03:56.486 --> 03:58.404
There's a way to take out the parasite.

03:58.488 --> 04:01.532
If you tell me who knows,
I'll let them live.

04:04.077 --> 04:05.161
I knew it.

04:06.537 --> 04:09.374
So there is a way
to take out the parasite.

04:09.457 --> 04:11.084
Yes. Who is it?

04:12.126 --> 04:12.961
Tell me.

04:16.214 --> 04:18.132
- It's Jin Mu, my lord.
- Jin Mu?

04:18.633 --> 04:19.467
No, it's…

04:21.010 --> 04:23.179
It's actually Park Jin of Songrim.

04:23.263 --> 04:24.097
[gasps]

04:26.683 --> 04:27.517
What?

04:27.600 --> 04:28.851
Actually…

04:30.061 --> 04:32.689
[suspenseful music intensifies]

04:32.772 --> 04:34.524
It's His Majesty the King.

04:38.403 --> 04:40.863
[ominous music playing]

04:42.782 --> 04:45.493
I was going to grant you
a painless death if you told me.

04:46.160 --> 04:47.412
I see what I must do now.

04:49.372 --> 04:51.541
Let's see
if you still won't tell me the truth

04:52.166 --> 04:53.376
after you take this.

04:54.335 --> 04:55.503
[So-i grunts]

04:55.586 --> 04:57.588
[eerie music playing]

05:00.550 --> 05:02.135
[chokes]

05:04.637 --> 05:05.513
[female mage] Lady Jin.

05:07.807 --> 05:09.684
Jang Uk wishes to see you, my lady.

05:09.767 --> 05:11.769
Now? Tell him I've gone to bed.

05:11.853 --> 05:13.438
He already knows you're not in your room.

05:13.521 --> 05:16.232
It won't be good
if he starts looking around.

05:18.860 --> 05:19.819
[So-i groans]

05:20.320 --> 05:22.113
[pants]

05:29.120 --> 05:30.413
What brings you here now?

05:30.496 --> 05:32.040
I came here to ask you for a favor.

05:32.749 --> 05:35.960
Please, allow me to enter Jinyowon
for just a moment.

05:36.544 --> 05:37.378
Jinyowon?

05:37.462 --> 05:40.131
Bu-yeon might have just secretly let me in
if I asked,

05:40.214 --> 05:42.967
but that didn't seem appropriate,
so I'm asking you.

05:44.719 --> 05:46.721
[tense music playing]

06:05.823 --> 06:07.575
So-i, wake up.

06:08.326 --> 06:09.786
So-i, do you recognize me?

06:10.828 --> 06:11.662
Seo Yul?

06:12.455 --> 06:13.539
Good.

06:14.123 --> 06:15.208
[So-i groans]

06:15.291 --> 06:16.250
[Seo Yul] Hold on to me.

06:19.170 --> 06:20.671
She says there's a way.

06:23.257 --> 06:26.094
Jin Ho-gyeong says
there's a way to get rid of the parasite.

06:26.719 --> 06:27.553
We have no time.

06:28.179 --> 06:29.097
Let's talk outside.

06:31.974 --> 06:33.101
Jin Bu-yeon?

06:33.184 --> 06:36.062
Are you okay? Did my mother do this?

06:36.646 --> 06:37.730
[So-i gasps]

06:38.606 --> 06:41.609
So you really think
that you're Jin Bu-yeon then.

06:41.692 --> 06:42.985
What do you mean?

06:43.069 --> 06:44.737
[So-i breathes heavily]

06:46.239 --> 06:47.365
She helped me find you.

06:48.825 --> 06:50.034
[Seo Yul] We need to leave now.

07:03.381 --> 07:05.800
This is the fire bird.

07:06.884 --> 07:08.511
I see it hasn't hatched yet.

07:08.594 --> 07:11.305
If the fire bird hatches
and flies to the sky,

07:11.389 --> 07:13.307
the entire world will dry out.

07:13.391 --> 07:14.809
If the egg is taken,

07:15.643 --> 07:16.686
Jinyowon will crumble?

07:18.271 --> 07:19.105
Oh.

07:20.022 --> 07:22.608
I would never take it from you,
so don't worry, Lady Jin.

07:22.692 --> 07:24.318
It's strange! Master Lee…

07:24.402 --> 07:26.571
could have just asked me
to show this to him.

07:27.905 --> 07:30.575
Why would he ask you to come check?

07:30.658 --> 07:32.118
Because he doesn't trust you.

07:32.827 --> 07:35.079
You once revealed the ice stone
without thinking twice.

07:35.788 --> 07:38.875
That was the decision I made
to save my unborn daughter, Bu-yeon.

07:39.876 --> 07:42.962
The person
who didn't return it after using it

07:43.671 --> 07:45.173
was your father, Jang Gang, no?

07:46.674 --> 07:50.761
In the end,
that stone wound up inside his son.

07:52.638 --> 07:54.724
I guess there're too many reasons
for you to hate me,

07:54.807 --> 07:57.018
for us to ever actually
get along with each other.

07:57.101 --> 07:59.645
That's the reason I wanted
to put an end to all of this.

08:00.480 --> 08:02.148
She was fine under my protection.

08:02.732 --> 08:04.150
Why would you take her from me?

08:04.233 --> 08:05.318
Yes, why?

08:06.360 --> 08:07.862
I saw the reality of your protection.

08:09.030 --> 08:11.908
That dismal room
and the thread sewn into her back

08:11.991 --> 08:13.910
was really the protection
of a loving mother?

08:14.744 --> 08:15.995
Just fine, really?

08:16.621 --> 08:17.455
Ah.

08:18.164 --> 08:20.041
Is that what you consider love, Lady Jin?

08:21.000 --> 08:23.377
Poking somebody with needles in dark room?

08:23.461 --> 08:24.712
No, I had to do it

08:25.505 --> 08:27.006
to protect her. She's my eldest.

08:27.089 --> 08:29.091
She has a duty to fulfill.

08:29.175 --> 08:31.177
Protect Jinyowon
by carrying on the family line.

08:31.260 --> 08:32.762
Are you trying to pressure me right now?

08:32.845 --> 08:36.682
[tense music playing]

08:37.391 --> 08:39.936
Then you could have at least
served a brood hen for dinner.

08:40.853 --> 08:43.314
But then again,
you showed me this fire bird instead.

08:43.397 --> 08:45.024
I guess that's positive.

08:56.285 --> 08:58.204
[Bu-yeon] The person
Seo Yul was looking for was hurt bad.

08:58.287 --> 08:59.956
- [Jang Uk] Who was it?
- [Bu-yeon] A woman.

09:00.498 --> 09:02.625
Her name was So-i, I think.

09:05.670 --> 09:06.504
So-i?

09:12.385 --> 09:13.302
[groans softly]

09:19.183 --> 09:20.893
Seeing as how you saved me…

09:22.687 --> 09:24.647
I guess you got the message I sent you.

09:25.273 --> 09:26.107
Yes.

09:26.941 --> 09:28.025
[So-i] It's the truth.

09:28.109 --> 09:30.152
Mu-deok, who's from Sari Village…

09:32.071 --> 09:33.823
is Ho-gyeong's real daughter.

09:33.906 --> 09:36.284
Then that means that
the current Jin Bu-yeon is a fake one?

09:40.621 --> 09:43.082
I came to see her
because that's what I thought also.

09:44.792 --> 09:46.252
But she's actually her daughter.

09:47.211 --> 09:49.088
- What?
- Ho-gyeong said

09:49.171 --> 09:52.383
she took Mu-deok's dead body
out of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho

09:52.466 --> 09:53.384
and saved her.

09:53.467 --> 09:56.679
But that the soul
still within the body was…

09:58.472 --> 09:59.307
Naksu.

09:59.390 --> 10:01.225
[dramatic stinger]

10:02.393 --> 10:03.311
Naksu?

10:03.394 --> 10:04.228
Yes.

10:05.229 --> 10:07.523
Naksu is alive within Jin Bu-yeon's body.

10:08.733 --> 10:10.651
But Jin Bu-yeon's current face is…

10:11.944 --> 10:13.237
Naksu's face.

10:25.833 --> 10:27.293
[Seo Yul] No wonder she looks so familiar.

10:28.419 --> 10:30.630
I failed to recognize her
because I never imagined

10:31.339 --> 10:32.632
that I'd see her again.

10:34.759 --> 10:35.593
[Bu-yeon] There you are.

10:38.763 --> 10:40.765
["Just Watching You"
by Jeong Sewoon playing]

11:17.718 --> 11:18.928
[Seo Yul] She is alive.

11:21.013 --> 11:21.889
Jin Bu-yeon…

11:23.599 --> 11:24.725
was her all along.

11:33.984 --> 11:34.985
Are you all right?

11:42.034 --> 11:43.661
You're about to cry, Yul.

11:46.914 --> 11:47.748
Are you…

11:48.999 --> 11:49.959
feeling sick still?

11:58.509 --> 11:59.593
What's wrong?

12:00.177 --> 12:01.262
[Bu-yeon] Does it hurt?

12:02.888 --> 12:04.390
I'm very confused right now.

12:05.641 --> 12:07.101
I'm afraid I've lost my way.

12:09.019 --> 12:09.979
For a moment…

12:11.689 --> 12:13.023
For a moment, I'll stay like this.

12:19.572 --> 12:21.407
["Just Watching You" continues playing]

12:49.226 --> 12:50.853
I can't let you stay like this, Yul.

12:51.395 --> 12:53.856
I think that it's best I tell Jang Uk.

12:58.152 --> 12:59.153
Don't tell him.

13:01.322 --> 13:02.740
I don't wish for him to find out.

13:14.043 --> 13:15.503
[Yong-pil] We haven't done anything wrong.

13:17.213 --> 13:20.424
Seo Yul… Seo Yul is
the one that let us in.

13:20.508 --> 13:21.342
Seo Yul did?

13:22.718 --> 13:23.886
[sighs]

13:23.969 --> 13:24.803
[Seo Yul] He's right.

13:28.390 --> 13:30.601
It's all true. Let him go.

13:36.440 --> 13:39.026
What happened?
I heard the girl you saved is So-i.

13:40.444 --> 13:41.654
So why are you helping her?

13:42.238 --> 13:43.280
Did she do something to you?

13:43.364 --> 13:44.365
Don't worry.

13:45.115 --> 13:46.742
I was, in fact, indebted to her.

13:47.826 --> 13:51.247
So I tried to return the favor
by helping her escape.

13:51.330 --> 13:53.207
Okay, but why are you indebted to her?

13:53.290 --> 13:55.334
She cared for me when I was hurt,

13:56.252 --> 13:57.586
trapped inside the barrier.

13:58.420 --> 13:59.630
Young Lady Heo also knows.

14:01.006 --> 14:01.840
I see.

14:03.175 --> 14:05.553
Still, you snuck in Jinyowon.
That's dangerous!

14:08.138 --> 14:10.307
Well, you helped me out, thank you.

14:11.350 --> 14:12.184
[sighs]

14:14.895 --> 14:17.690
Anything else I should know
or can help you with?

14:19.608 --> 14:21.277
Not now. This has to be my burden.

14:22.903 --> 14:23.946
It's on me this time.

14:32.162 --> 14:32.997
[Jang Uk sighs]

14:34.206 --> 14:37.918
He was too fast for us to see his face,
but it was for sure a man.

14:38.502 --> 14:39.378
Who could it be?

14:40.087 --> 14:41.547
[So-i] It's Jin Mu, my lord.

14:41.630 --> 14:42.464
No, it's…

14:43.966 --> 14:46.051
It's actually Park Jin of Songrim.

14:46.760 --> 14:48.429
It's His Majesty the King.

14:48.512 --> 14:49.471
[sighs deeply]

14:50.890 --> 14:53.058
None of them can find out about the truth.

14:54.393 --> 14:55.519
No one can know!

14:57.938 --> 15:00.649
[dramatic music intensifies]

15:09.158 --> 15:13.871
Well, her injuries aren't severe.
She'll be fine if you apply this ointment.

15:13.954 --> 15:14.788
[sighs in relief]

15:15.581 --> 15:16.540
Thank you so much.

15:26.216 --> 15:27.092
[Jang Uk] Oh.

15:28.594 --> 15:30.095
Young Master Seo is right.

15:30.179 --> 15:33.641
So-i really took good care of him
back when he was injured.

15:34.475 --> 15:36.352
WelI, I have no reason to not believe you.

15:36.435 --> 15:40.314
She even cut herself
to share her blood and energy with him.

15:40.898 --> 15:41.899
She shared her blood with him?

15:41.982 --> 15:45.778
It didn't help that much,
but it shows how much she cared.

15:47.237 --> 15:48.072
[sighs]

15:48.155 --> 15:49.406
You're staying at Jeongjingak?

15:50.324 --> 15:52.910
I'm also staying here
to take care of So-i.

16:01.210 --> 16:02.044
I thought…

16:03.003 --> 16:06.048
you and Young Master Jang
were supposed to be at Jinyowon.

16:06.131 --> 16:07.174
We just got back.

16:07.716 --> 16:09.551
We only left a bit early to help a friend.

16:09.635 --> 16:10.469
Ah.

16:11.095 --> 16:15.683
To Young Master Jang, helping his friend
must be far more important to him, right?

16:15.766 --> 16:18.143
It's not like you are any help
to his friend like my Young Lady,

16:18.227 --> 16:20.771
so you can just head home.
I'll take you, we can go together.

16:20.854 --> 16:22.564
The friend I was talking about…

16:22.648 --> 16:25.067
You should know wasn't actually
my husband's friend but mine.

16:25.150 --> 16:28.654
Then… Young Master Seo
is actually your friend too?

16:28.737 --> 16:30.614
Of course. I'm here for a reason.

16:32.533 --> 16:34.451
I need to go talk to my friend, Seo Yul.

16:34.535 --> 16:35.953
I'm gonna head upstairs now.

16:38.872 --> 16:40.332
What do you have to talk about with Yul?

16:41.667 --> 16:43.544
[Sun-i] She says she's friends
with Young Master Seo.

16:43.627 --> 16:45.629
That's right. So I should talk to him.

16:45.713 --> 16:48.298
So then, you're not going home?

16:48.382 --> 16:50.467
Not now, I'm also going to stay.

16:54.555 --> 16:56.557
Goodbye then, Young Master Jang.

16:57.224 --> 16:58.100
[Jang Uk] Yes, see you.

16:58.183 --> 16:59.560
- I'll be heading home now.
- [sighs]

17:01.520 --> 17:03.147
[quirky music playing]

17:10.487 --> 17:12.740
[soft music playing]

17:13.657 --> 17:14.950
Just come home with me.

17:18.579 --> 17:20.664
Okay. Fine.

17:20.748 --> 17:21.999
Let's go now.

17:37.473 --> 17:38.557
[sighs]

17:40.392 --> 17:43.062
So, when did you become friends with Yul?

17:43.854 --> 17:44.980
We agreed to be friends

17:45.064 --> 17:47.649
because we are both foolish
in our own ways.

17:48.484 --> 17:49.568
[Jang Uk scoffs]

17:49.651 --> 17:52.112
You may be a fool, but Yul is far from it.

17:53.030 --> 17:54.615
He gets lost when he's flustered.

17:56.825 --> 17:57.910
He told you that?

17:58.869 --> 18:01.121
Well, I happened to find out over time.

18:01.205 --> 18:02.998
How much time
did you spend with him to know that?

18:03.082 --> 18:07.294
Well, we went to Chwiseonru together,
Gaema Village together.

18:08.420 --> 18:09.338
Ah.

18:10.255 --> 18:13.592
So-i was the one who I met
in Gaema Village before.

18:13.675 --> 18:14.843
What? When?

18:14.927 --> 18:17.638
I remember she stole something from me,
and Seo Yul helped me that day.

18:18.555 --> 18:19.389
[scoffs]
Seriously?

18:21.934 --> 18:23.936
There's so much that happened
I don't know about.

18:25.270 --> 18:27.022
You two must be good friends.

18:28.440 --> 18:30.818
I actually thought he was the man
I was supposed to marry

18:30.901 --> 18:32.861
when we first met at Chwiseonru, you know.

18:34.196 --> 18:37.282
Had we met before,
I may have never even run away.

18:37.366 --> 18:38.242
Oh.

18:39.660 --> 18:42.913
You must be sad. Yul would…
would have made a good husband.

18:43.580 --> 18:45.207
He's handsome and kind.

18:46.625 --> 18:49.294
He wouldn't have said he was going crazy
just from holding my hand.

18:50.712 --> 18:53.006
Do you… feel fine now?

19:02.808 --> 19:04.601
You told me to see you for who you are.

19:05.561 --> 19:07.104
That is what I'm trying to do right now.

19:17.030 --> 19:19.533
Jang Uk, summon some fireflies.

19:20.826 --> 19:22.870
That is definitely not
an easy thing to do, you know.

19:24.329 --> 19:27.374
Then… how about
setting off some fireworks?

19:27.958 --> 19:30.294
Hey, you know how expensive that is, huh?

19:30.377 --> 19:33.380
[Jang Uk] Besides, where am I supposed
to find fireworks right now?

19:34.047 --> 19:36.842
Don't tell anyone Jin Bu-yeon is Naksu.

19:36.925 --> 19:38.302
Don't worry. I wouldn't do that.

19:38.385 --> 19:41.638
We need to keep the secret
so Ho-gyeong can save your life.

19:42.472 --> 19:44.057
Jang Uk must not know this either.

19:45.976 --> 19:46.894
I know that.

19:48.395 --> 19:49.730
Uk has gone through enough.

19:51.857 --> 19:52.733
So it's on me now.

19:52.816 --> 19:53.984
Why is it on you?

19:54.735 --> 19:56.904
What responsibility
do you have for Naksu though?

19:56.987 --> 19:58.488
Because I also found out.

19:59.907 --> 20:01.158
You also knew that…

20:03.118 --> 20:04.995
Mu-deok was the soul shifter Naksu?

20:08.582 --> 20:10.876
Then you kept it a secret
when you knew? Why?

20:10.959 --> 20:13.086
The physician said
that you should recover soon.

20:13.670 --> 20:16.381
I'll find you a place to stay,
so you should leave when you can.

20:32.648 --> 20:34.441
[somber music playing]

21:01.009 --> 21:03.553
- [gasps]
- [eerie music playing]

21:14.564 --> 21:15.565
[groans softly]

21:16.984 --> 21:18.986
[eerie music continues playing]

21:20.737 --> 21:21.738
[gasps]

21:26.201 --> 21:27.494
[So-i] Young Master, are you okay?

21:28.662 --> 21:29.538
Does it hurt?

21:30.372 --> 21:31.832
It's just a nightmare I often have.

21:33.041 --> 21:34.918
Is it the woman who always appears…

21:36.253 --> 21:37.087
in your dreams?

21:44.094 --> 21:48.098
I understand because I also have
something that encapsulates my feelings.

21:49.182 --> 21:50.726
Since you are still holding on to it…

21:53.228 --> 21:54.438
your feelings haven't changed at all.

21:54.521 --> 21:56.690
So I should throw this away then.

21:59.651 --> 22:01.737
Because if you're right,
it means all my pain…

22:06.742 --> 22:07.993
is because I kept this.

22:14.333 --> 22:15.375
So by any chance,

22:16.543 --> 22:17.836
are you planning on getting rid of her?

22:18.920 --> 22:21.256
Then you can't receive Jinyowon's help,
and you will die too.

22:21.840 --> 22:22.883
I know.

22:22.966 --> 22:24.634
I do not plan to kill her…

22:28.347 --> 22:29.639
and still expect to live?

22:29.723 --> 22:30.724
Exactly!

22:31.224 --> 22:33.310
Exactly! You can't do that
if you wish to live.

22:35.812 --> 22:37.105
Plus, you like her, don't you?

22:38.523 --> 22:41.151
[somber music playing]

22:45.864 --> 22:46.740
Go get some rest.

23:02.631 --> 23:03.799
Young Master.

23:06.968 --> 23:07.803
I…

23:09.221 --> 23:10.931
I am officially engaged

23:12.140 --> 23:14.226
to Lord Park Jin of Songrim.

23:19.856 --> 23:21.399
Why are you not saying anything?

23:22.776 --> 23:24.653
Are you mad at me for getting married?

23:25.612 --> 23:27.364
- Should I not?
- I… I mean…

23:28.657 --> 23:30.867
I just don't know
what to call you in such situations.

23:31.868 --> 23:32.702
[chuckles]

23:34.037 --> 23:36.081
Just call me Maidservant Kim, please.

23:36.164 --> 23:38.208
Even if I marry Lord Park,

23:39.459 --> 23:42.671
you'll always be my dear young master.

23:43.213 --> 23:45.173
No, that's not it.

23:47.259 --> 23:49.636
You are the person
I'm most grateful for in this world,

23:51.221 --> 23:52.722
so I couldn't just say…

23:54.474 --> 23:55.725
congrats, Maidservant Kim.

23:56.601 --> 23:57.602
[sobs]

23:57.686 --> 23:59.813
[emotional music playing]

23:59.896 --> 24:01.565
It doesn't matter what you call me,

24:03.400 --> 24:05.861
I may call you young master,

24:07.028 --> 24:07.863
but you…

24:09.573 --> 24:10.657
are like a son to me.

24:16.663 --> 24:17.497
I…

24:18.999 --> 24:20.292
feel the same.

24:24.254 --> 24:25.172
Maidservant Kim.

24:32.512 --> 24:33.430
Congrats!

24:34.598 --> 24:36.057
[sobs]

24:37.642 --> 24:38.727
My young master.

24:48.945 --> 24:52.324
The reason we visited you last night
was to show all these.

24:53.658 --> 24:55.952
Once again,
congratulations on your engagement.

24:56.036 --> 24:58.288
[all] Congratulations!

24:58.371 --> 25:00.040
Thank you, everyone.
[chuckles softly]

25:00.123 --> 25:04.085
Gosh! I'll finally be
getting an aunt after all.

25:04.169 --> 25:06.880
Then should I look forward
to a niece or nephew?

25:10.258 --> 25:11.760
Know when to stop talking, okay?

25:11.843 --> 25:13.970
- [chuckles]
- Why stop so soon?

25:14.054 --> 25:17.515
[Jin] You say a bunch of these were found
in dried-up wells in and around Daeho?

25:17.599 --> 25:20.852
Yes, these boatmen here
also found some in the canal.

25:20.936 --> 25:23.980
Someone seems quite determined
to dry up all the water.

25:24.064 --> 25:27.275
I'll find out where they were created
and where exactly they're coming from.

25:27.359 --> 25:30.528
They contain the energy of a volcano,
so they're probably made there.

25:30.612 --> 25:33.990
Thoroughly examine all the items
that come in from the far south.

25:34.950 --> 25:35.784
Yes.

25:36.284 --> 25:38.328
[tense music playing]

25:41.164 --> 25:44.167
Songrim will be inspecting
incoming goods on all the boats?

25:44.251 --> 25:48.046
Yes. I can no longer make an exception
for your boat to pass.

25:54.427 --> 25:57.931
I think the boat from the volcano
should be arriving at Daeho Fortress soon.

25:58.014 --> 25:58.848
[sucks teeth]

26:00.267 --> 26:02.894
Send a homing bird
and tell them to discard everything.

26:02.978 --> 26:03.812
Yes, lord.

26:07.774 --> 26:08.692
[exhales angrily]

26:09.359 --> 26:11.361
[tense music continues playing]

26:23.581 --> 26:25.000
He wants us to get rid of all of it?

26:25.667 --> 26:28.461
But is it okay to discard
such things into the lake?

26:28.545 --> 26:31.214
Quiet! We just need to do
what we are told.

26:31.965 --> 26:33.008
Get on with it.

26:38.430 --> 26:41.224
[Jang Uk]
I checked the fire bird in Jinyowon.

26:41.308 --> 26:44.853
It was much smaller than I expected,
but it was safe and sound.

26:44.936 --> 26:45.770
Really?

26:46.354 --> 26:48.565
I thought
that you didn't want to get involved.

26:49.190 --> 26:51.443
I mean I had to go anyway,
so I just checked while I was there.

26:51.526 --> 26:54.321
You don't usually lift a finger
if you don't want to.

26:54.404 --> 26:55.697
You actually went there and checked?

26:56.823 --> 26:58.616
I really don't wish to get involved.

26:59.534 --> 27:00.952
I'm only telling you because I heard it.

27:01.036 --> 27:04.456
There are so many people
who want the fire bird.

27:05.165 --> 27:06.374
There's unrest all over

27:06.458 --> 27:09.002
as the drought has dried up
all the wells and canals.

27:09.586 --> 27:11.588
Please allow
the Unanimous Assembly to gather

27:11.671 --> 27:14.466
so we can advance
the rite of the lake now, Sire.

27:14.549 --> 27:15.383
[Sun] It's strange

27:15.467 --> 27:19.346
that even the wells and canals
are drying up because of the drought.

27:19.429 --> 27:22.474
Fortunately, since Jang Uk
got rid of Naksu,

27:22.557 --> 27:25.602
the fear of soul shifters in the capital
has died down considerably.

27:26.728 --> 27:29.647
Crown Prince, visit Jang Uk
and reward him like always.

27:30.231 --> 27:33.818
Majesty, you must give him
a bigger reward this time.

27:36.363 --> 27:39.324
Appoint him as the general
of the North Fortress and send him.

27:40.700 --> 27:41.659
You want…

27:42.452 --> 27:44.371
me to send him outside of Daeho?

27:44.954 --> 27:47.791
[Sun] Without him, the people
in the capital will grow uneasy.

27:47.874 --> 27:52.253
Right now, Cheonbugwan has arguably
more mages than Songrim has ever had.

27:52.796 --> 27:55.215
If the Crown Prince,
who has been chosen by the King's Star,

27:55.298 --> 27:57.008
takes lead of these mages,

27:57.634 --> 27:59.552
no one will be anxious again.

28:07.685 --> 28:08.561
[sighs]

28:10.105 --> 28:12.649
[Master Lee] When the world suffered
from drought 200 years ago,

28:12.732 --> 28:14.526
the ice stone fell from the sky.

28:14.609 --> 28:16.236
It looks like these people

28:16.319 --> 28:18.613
are trying to do the same thing
by waking the bird.

28:18.696 --> 28:22.075
The royal family and Cheonbugwan
are the ones that are behind it.

28:22.826 --> 28:26.287
Do you wish that I fight against them
and put an end to it, Master Lee?

28:26.371 --> 28:28.832
A fight like that
would be considered a revolt.

28:32.502 --> 28:33.878
If you did win the fight,

28:34.754 --> 28:37.340
you could even find yourself
on the throne.

28:39.217 --> 28:40.135
[Master Lee] What?

28:40.218 --> 28:41.469
You already know that as well.

28:41.553 --> 28:44.055
The King's Star,
which is believed to be the Prince's,

28:44.973 --> 28:46.683
rightfully belongs to you.

28:50.437 --> 28:53.356
Then that means you also know
who your real father is.

28:55.108 --> 28:57.318
How long do you plan to keep me in here?

28:57.402 --> 28:58.778
Just because I wish…

28:59.779 --> 29:01.030
to keep you locked up…

29:02.532 --> 29:03.533
doesn't mean I can.

29:03.616 --> 29:05.660
[Jin]
You possess the power of the ice stone.

29:06.828 --> 29:08.663
I know you're holding back for my sake.

29:08.747 --> 29:09.789
This was…

29:10.832 --> 29:13.251
Jin Mu and the royal family
who's been supporting him.

29:13.334 --> 29:14.544
I won't stop until I find out

29:14.627 --> 29:16.212
- what they did to her.
- And do what?

29:18.256 --> 29:19.924
Will you go and kill all of them?

29:20.008 --> 29:22.177
Like you said, it's not impossible
with the power I have now.

29:22.260 --> 29:24.804
To fight against Cheonbugwan
and the royal family is treason.

29:25.722 --> 29:28.349
Do you mean to use your power
to throw the world into chaos?

29:28.433 --> 29:29.601
Who cares!

29:32.228 --> 29:33.980
This world is the last thing I care about.

29:35.690 --> 29:38.234
The one person in this world
I wanted to protect died…

29:40.403 --> 29:41.738
in the most brutal way possible.

29:51.122 --> 29:52.040
This is…

29:55.335 --> 29:58.046
the gold plaque and letter
that the father…

29:59.672 --> 30:02.509
that you have been wondering about
left just for you.

30:06.513 --> 30:08.223
[Jin] Jang Gang briefly switched bodies

30:08.306 --> 30:10.225
with your father
using the alchemy of souls.

30:10.892 --> 30:14.479
The baby your mother gave birth to
after that man's soul pursued her…

30:16.147 --> 30:16.981
is you, Uk.

30:18.274 --> 30:20.944
You are the son of the late King.

30:23.947 --> 30:25.615
Born by the alchemy of souls.

30:27.033 --> 30:28.827
A boy who couldn't have been born

30:30.245 --> 30:31.830
and shouldn't have been born as well.

30:31.913 --> 30:32.872
Are you saying that…

30:34.499 --> 30:36.167
simply being born is a crime in itself?

30:36.251 --> 30:37.502
The night of your birth…

30:39.128 --> 30:40.296
the King's Star appeared.

30:42.841 --> 30:46.219
And to conceal that,
Naksu's father, Cho Chung, died.

30:46.803 --> 30:49.639
Jang Gang also died
to take responsibility for it,

30:49.722 --> 30:51.057
to keep it all a secret.

30:51.140 --> 30:53.017
The one person you wished to protect too…

30:55.144 --> 30:58.106
was probably used and killed
by those who wanted you dead.

31:03.027 --> 31:04.863
[sobs]

31:05.405 --> 31:08.074
[tragic music playing]

31:09.909 --> 31:11.578
If you try to use the power

31:12.453 --> 31:14.247
that you gained by the King's Star

31:14.330 --> 31:16.916
merely to bring the entire world
into chaos, then I, too…

31:20.295 --> 31:22.005
will stop you even if…

31:24.090 --> 31:24.966
I die.

31:25.466 --> 31:27.468
[dramatic music playing]

31:34.517 --> 31:36.519
[sobs]

31:41.149 --> 31:42.567
[Jang Uk] I found myself already guilty

31:43.568 --> 31:45.320
of existing when I should not.

31:46.487 --> 31:49.282
From that moment,
I vowed to not do anything.

31:49.365 --> 31:50.199
Jang Uk.

31:51.200 --> 31:53.202
"If you won't do anything, then just die."

31:55.538 --> 31:57.415
That's what your master
always used to tell you.

31:58.666 --> 32:00.710
My master, Master Seo Gyeong,

32:00.793 --> 32:03.171
was also born
with the energy of the King's Star,

32:03.254 --> 32:04.505
but he didn't become King.

32:04.589 --> 32:06.799
Instead, he protected the world.

32:06.883 --> 32:09.135
How can I protect the world
when I couldn't even…

32:10.637 --> 32:12.013
protect just one person?

32:13.806 --> 32:16.351
I suppose you are not thrilled
to have such power

32:17.685 --> 32:18.978
since you acquired it by…

32:19.062 --> 32:21.731
- getting killed by that person.
- That Master Seo Gyeong.

32:22.774 --> 32:24.442
Why did he choose
to leave the ice stone behind?

32:24.525 --> 32:26.819
Did you not know
that he wrote in Words of the Heart

32:26.903 --> 32:28.696
that he left it to save Jin Seol-ran?

32:28.780 --> 32:30.323
But Jin Seol-ran died in the end.

32:30.406 --> 32:33.368
So then why did he keep it
inside Jinyowon?

32:33.451 --> 32:35.870
Maybe he left it for you.
You're born the same way.

32:38.748 --> 32:39.582
I'm leaving.

32:43.086 --> 32:43.920
[scoffs]

32:48.549 --> 32:49.467
[sighs]

32:53.596 --> 32:55.598
[suspenseful music playing]

33:00.937 --> 33:01.771
We found them, sir.

33:05.733 --> 33:06.776
[Sang-ho] They really are here.

33:10.154 --> 33:11.072
You're so incredible.

33:12.740 --> 33:16.202
I can see why people are saying
that you remind them of Jin Seol-ran.

33:16.285 --> 33:18.955
To see the energy of all these
is quite amazing.

33:20.039 --> 33:22.750
That's all I can really do for now.

33:22.834 --> 33:25.003
You said your powers
would return with your memories.

33:25.962 --> 33:28.589
Then tell me.
Have you regained many memories?

33:30.216 --> 33:32.093
Yes, I've seen several actually.

33:33.219 --> 33:34.262
But they aren't really mine.

33:36.097 --> 33:39.225
I'm able to see
other people's memories as well.

33:40.309 --> 33:43.187
It seems
my divine powers are getting stronger.

33:43.771 --> 33:46.232
I see. I'm really glad to hear that.

33:49.110 --> 33:52.321
If those red birds are dangerous,
should I keep looking for them?

33:53.322 --> 33:54.407
Yes, please, if you would.

33:55.074 --> 33:56.492
I suppose I can avoid

33:56.576 --> 33:59.495
objects with dangerous energy
when I'm with you by my side.

34:00.621 --> 34:02.623
People with bad energy
should be avoided also.

34:03.666 --> 34:05.501
So you've seen anyone like that?

34:06.544 --> 34:08.713
People's energy is not always consistent.

34:08.796 --> 34:10.590
Some are so bad that…

34:10.673 --> 34:12.800
it's practically suffocating
being close to them.

34:18.473 --> 34:20.975
[Queen] People say you,
Jin Cho-yeon, resemble spring,

34:21.059 --> 34:23.394
the most beautiful season among the four.

34:25.146 --> 34:26.189
You truly are

34:27.190 --> 34:29.150
overflowing with a beautiful liveliness.

34:30.651 --> 34:31.736
Thank you so much.

34:35.990 --> 34:38.076
A withered person like me here…

34:39.786 --> 34:42.663
- is desperate for the spring.
- [Cho-yeon gasps softly]

34:44.707 --> 34:46.542
[eerie music playing]

34:51.839 --> 34:54.801
I have taken a liking to you. Visit often.

34:56.219 --> 34:58.387
I would like to get a glimpse now and then

34:59.430 --> 35:01.599
of the spring that is to come.

35:03.392 --> 35:04.227
Yeah.

35:11.692 --> 35:15.363
Royal Highness, why do you suddenly wish
to hunt so far away?

35:15.446 --> 35:16.948
It's suffocating being here.

35:18.074 --> 35:20.159
I wish to depart
as soon as possible, so pack lightly.

35:21.119 --> 35:22.286
Yes, Your Highness.

35:26.332 --> 35:28.167
[indistinct chatter]

35:34.048 --> 35:35.967
Let me know right away
if you see the energy.

35:36.050 --> 35:37.927
- And we'll stop the boat there.
- Of course.

35:43.975 --> 35:45.226
Wait! Stop the boat.

35:46.060 --> 35:47.145
Stop now.

35:47.979 --> 35:51.524
[suspenseful music playing]

35:53.651 --> 35:56.154
- [Bu-yeon grunts, breathes heavily]
- [quirky music playing]

35:57.029 --> 35:59.949
[Bu-yeon] I definitely remember
dangling like this from here once.

36:00.449 --> 36:01.284
When?

36:01.367 --> 36:02.368
Why?

36:03.870 --> 36:04.829
Am I so weak?

36:11.878 --> 36:15.423
Wh-What's the matter?
Why did you suddenly dangle from there?

36:16.507 --> 36:17.758
I dangled from there

36:18.843 --> 36:20.636
and realized
that I didn't have any strength.

36:22.555 --> 36:24.182
Ah… right.

36:25.183 --> 36:26.976
It seems like you are exhausted.

36:27.602 --> 36:30.771
I think it is best
that you get some rest soon.

36:37.028 --> 36:38.196
[Bu-yeon] This is my memory.

36:39.155 --> 36:40.990
I even remember my arms hurting.

36:48.998 --> 36:51.000
Can't believe I forgot
to take the turtle with me.

36:51.083 --> 36:52.418
I almost left it here alone.

36:52.960 --> 36:54.962
I told the owner of the inn
to take care of it.

36:55.046 --> 36:57.965
Still, imagine how anxious it'll be
if its owner doesn't show.

37:05.264 --> 37:06.807
Please go and get some fresh air,
Eunuch Oh.

37:06.891 --> 37:09.060
- Huh?
- Go wait outside.

37:09.977 --> 37:10.811
Ah.

37:11.437 --> 37:12.438
Yes, Your Highness.

37:21.864 --> 37:23.616
"My strength has disappeared…"

37:25.034 --> 37:26.744
Does that mean I was strong before then?

37:28.913 --> 37:30.456
It doesn't like it.

37:30.539 --> 37:32.583
Eunuch Oh. Hello again.

37:33.209 --> 37:35.503
That turtle only likes to eat
meat wrapped in lettuce.

37:35.586 --> 37:37.171
- Seriously?
- Are you that dumb?

37:37.255 --> 37:39.465
It's only refusing you
because you're not its owner.

37:40.883 --> 37:41.717
Here, watch.

37:42.510 --> 37:44.887
Look here, turtle. Have some lettuce.

37:45.388 --> 37:46.222
Eat up.

37:48.266 --> 37:50.226
- [gasps]
- [chuckles]

37:50.309 --> 37:54.188
You see? It only cares for me. So clever!

37:54.272 --> 37:55.606
You see how fast it moved?

37:55.690 --> 37:58.025
I bet he's the fastest turtle
in all of Daeho.

37:58.734 --> 38:01.737
This turtle's so lucky
to have someone so kind.

38:03.656 --> 38:04.490
Why?

38:05.199 --> 38:07.451
Why do you say that?
Has your husband not come back yet?

38:08.286 --> 38:10.079
He does come home more often now,

38:11.038 --> 38:12.248
but I'm still alone.

38:12.331 --> 38:14.375
Why live that way? You're a shaman.

38:14.458 --> 38:16.919
You should use a curse charm
on the peacock and have her leave.

38:17.420 --> 38:19.839
Or just feed your husband a potion
that will make him like you.

38:20.506 --> 38:22.425
You're too young to be woeful and alone.

38:22.508 --> 38:25.344
How would you know anything about marriage
when you're a eunuch though?

38:25.428 --> 38:26.512
- [Bu-yeon chuckles softly]
- [scoffs]

38:26.595 --> 38:27.930
Do you know what it means to be alone?

38:29.056 --> 38:31.225
Maybe not, but I do know your situation.

38:31.976 --> 38:34.353
If he left home, then at least
there's hope for his return.

38:34.937 --> 38:37.106
Leaving you alone like that,
means it's over.

38:37.189 --> 38:39.233
If he's constantly running around
from room to room,

38:39.317 --> 38:40.318
then just move out already.

38:40.401 --> 38:41.736
You're right, Eunuch Oh.

38:42.528 --> 38:45.156
I won't just stay in a room
all alone ever again.

38:45.239 --> 38:47.033
There you go.
You should cheat on him as well.

38:47.116 --> 38:49.327
Stop giving me indecent solutions to this!

38:50.953 --> 38:54.165
I am saying
I want to find a room of my own.

38:55.499 --> 38:56.667
You don't even have your own room?

38:57.251 --> 38:58.085
[sighs]

38:58.169 --> 39:00.171
I feel anxious
because the room I stay in right now

39:00.254 --> 39:01.172
isn't mine.

39:02.298 --> 39:03.924
That's why he's confused also.

39:05.009 --> 39:06.510
And cannot come to find me, you know.

39:10.890 --> 39:12.308
I shall find a room that's truly mine.

39:13.517 --> 39:15.561
Thanks for the advice though.
It really helped.

39:15.644 --> 39:16.854
It did?

39:19.023 --> 39:20.816
Well, if you fail
to find a room on your own,

39:21.442 --> 39:23.235
- I have a lot of empty space.
- [chuckles softly]

39:24.987 --> 39:26.238
Where were you going?

39:28.032 --> 39:31.494
My house has so many rooms,
yet none of them make me feel at home.

39:32.244 --> 39:34.622
I guess you could say
it's like I am running away.

39:34.705 --> 39:37.166
You possess a noble energy
of someone who has it all,

39:37.249 --> 39:40.252
but in reality, it seems you, too,
have a peacock that bothers you.

39:41.045 --> 39:41.962
Yes, I do.

39:42.963 --> 39:45.800
There's a guy I really hate
who is too good to be true.

39:46.759 --> 39:48.094
Have you ever heard
of the tale of the crow

39:48.177 --> 39:50.304
that stole the peacock's feathers
and passed them as its own?

39:51.722 --> 39:52.807
I'm that crow now.

39:53.307 --> 39:55.726
If you feel uneasy
showing off what you've stolen,

39:55.810 --> 39:56.811
why don't you get rid of it?

39:58.229 --> 39:59.855
I've done too many awful things already.

40:00.731 --> 40:01.941
I know I'm hopeless now.

40:03.567 --> 40:04.819
You saved this turtle though.

40:06.320 --> 40:08.531
There's no way that it's hopeless for you.

40:10.449 --> 40:11.325
[scoffs]

40:12.076 --> 40:14.745
You may be bad at physiognomy,
but you certainly have a way with words.

40:14.829 --> 40:17.581
[gentle music playing]

40:21.377 --> 40:24.213
Thank you for trying to give me
a push with your words.

40:24.296 --> 40:26.090
I need to go finish what I was doing.

40:26.173 --> 40:27.383
Have a safe trip!

40:34.890 --> 40:37.143
Maybe I should visit Jang Uk
instead of going hunting,

40:38.477 --> 40:40.062
since he took care of you as well.

40:45.609 --> 40:46.694
[chuckles softly]

40:50.406 --> 40:52.491
I informed him in advance of your visit.

40:52.575 --> 40:53.909
How dare he not show up?

40:55.035 --> 40:56.454
I'll go and bring Jang Uk right now.

41:08.174 --> 41:12.386
THE FIRE BIRD'S EGG

41:13.471 --> 41:15.306
[ominous music playing]

41:15.389 --> 41:17.266
THE FIRE BIRD

41:20.144 --> 41:21.145
Fire bird.

41:21.729 --> 41:24.857
[Go Won]
So Jang Uk already knows about this.

41:31.822 --> 41:34.158
[suspenseful music playing]

41:34.241 --> 41:35.951
Are you here to reward me?

41:37.161 --> 41:38.120
You can just leave it and go.

41:38.204 --> 41:39.246
The King said…

41:40.164 --> 41:42.833
he'd like to give you
an even bigger award this time around.

41:43.459 --> 41:44.668
He plans to appoint you

41:44.752 --> 41:46.712
general of North Fortress
and send you there.

41:48.005 --> 41:48.964
Is that so?

41:49.965 --> 41:51.342
- That's far.
- If asked…

41:52.593 --> 41:53.427
will you go?

41:53.511 --> 41:57.348
Will that make you feel at ease
if I go that far away?

41:59.058 --> 42:00.309
Don't go if you don't want.

42:01.185 --> 42:02.853
It's true that you're a thorn in my side,

42:03.479 --> 42:05.523
but Jin Mu will always see you
as an obstacle.

42:05.606 --> 42:08.651
It seems you're finally uneasy
about holding hands with Jin Mu.

42:09.568 --> 42:10.736
But unfortunately,

42:11.654 --> 42:15.157
I have no desire
to be used as an obstacle for your sake.

42:19.495 --> 42:22.915
You must be thinking that I am trying
to use you to keep Jin Mu in check, right?

42:23.499 --> 42:24.542
[Go Won] I see.

42:24.625 --> 42:27.336
You won't change your mind
regardless of what I say.

42:27.419 --> 42:29.838
Why exactly are you saying
all of these things to me right now?

42:29.922 --> 42:33.342
- The turtle. Why did you take care of it?
- A turtle?

42:33.425 --> 42:35.844
Yeah, if you hate me so much,
then why did you take care of my turtle?

42:35.928 --> 42:38.430
That turtle was yours?
I thought it was Eunuch Oh's.

42:41.225 --> 42:42.059
[sighs]

42:42.643 --> 42:43.477
That's why.

42:44.562 --> 42:45.854
I see I was mistaken.

42:45.938 --> 42:47.064
Don't tell me

42:47.940 --> 42:49.900
you thought I was showing you favor

42:50.609 --> 42:52.653
because of some turtle.

42:52.736 --> 42:53.821
It's more than just a turtle.

42:55.364 --> 42:57.491
It gave me just enough hope
to come and talk to you

42:58.117 --> 43:00.953
despite the hatred and distrust
you have for me.

43:04.790 --> 43:05.624
Forget it.

43:06.292 --> 43:08.752
Since you've been reading
about the fire bird,

43:09.336 --> 43:10.379
you're not going up north.

43:11.088 --> 43:12.256
What will you do if I go?

43:13.966 --> 43:16.802
You wouldn't do anything
despite knowing how dangerous it is?

43:16.885 --> 43:19.096
[Jang Uk] I'm glad I left this book open.

43:19.722 --> 43:21.890
I got to see
an interesting expression on your face.

43:23.517 --> 43:25.144
If I did not hate you so much,

43:25.853 --> 43:26.979
I might have actually believed

43:27.062 --> 43:29.273
that you really cared
about the world, Your Highness.

43:32.234 --> 43:34.069
You possess such great power,

43:35.446 --> 43:37.615
yet you're worse than me,
at least I saved a turtle.

43:37.698 --> 43:40.618
That's because there's not a single thing
I wish to protect anymore.

43:40.701 --> 43:41.619
[Go Won] Listen, Jang Uk.

43:41.702 --> 43:44.496
Do you remember
what you said inside the barrier?

43:44.580 --> 43:45.956
You said you'd follow your master.

43:46.040 --> 43:48.208
You'd rather die
instead of doing nothing at all.

43:51.837 --> 43:54.798
You shone bright, even though
you had lost all of your energy.

43:56.216 --> 43:58.510
But now, despite having
such great powers, you are dead.

43:59.094 --> 44:01.430
Fine. Don't do anything, Jang Uk.

44:03.390 --> 44:04.683
Because you're already dead.

44:18.447 --> 44:19.365
What hope?

44:26.288 --> 44:27.289
[sighs]

44:35.589 --> 44:37.841
[Bu-yeon] The tree that I remember
was not this small.

44:39.593 --> 44:41.178
It was a lot bigger and taller.

44:44.473 --> 44:45.974
I was on top of that tree.

44:48.394 --> 44:51.814
The memory of me standing atop
all by myself…

44:53.273 --> 44:54.483
is definitely mine.

44:55.401 --> 44:58.028
[pensive music playing]

45:06.870 --> 45:08.497
I want to climb up again.

45:23.053 --> 45:25.431
[soft music playing]

45:37.609 --> 45:40.821
Are you in there?
Young Master, are you okay? Hello!

45:41.363 --> 45:42.865
- Open the door.
- [breathing heavily, groaning in pain]

45:42.948 --> 45:44.408
Please, I said open this door!

45:44.491 --> 45:45.826
I'm okay, please just go away.

45:45.909 --> 45:48.203
Oh, you're in pain.
Why haven't you gone to Jinyowon yet?

45:49.663 --> 45:50.497
[So-i] Fine.

45:50.581 --> 45:52.374
I guess I'll go see Jin Ho-gyeong again.

45:58.046 --> 45:59.465
Why in the world are you doing…

46:01.800 --> 46:03.260
Why are you doing this to yourself?

46:05.846 --> 46:07.473
Because I want to make up for…

46:08.474 --> 46:09.725
the regrets I always feel.

46:12.728 --> 46:13.979
This pain here…

46:14.062 --> 46:16.440
[somber music playing]

46:17.524 --> 46:19.234
is greater than what I usually feel.

46:20.944 --> 46:22.571
You gave me a chance to do that.

46:23.822 --> 46:25.157
I really thank you for that.

46:28.452 --> 46:29.745
So you do not need to…

46:30.871 --> 46:31.914
[gasps]

46:36.043 --> 46:37.336
…do anything more for me.

46:39.588 --> 46:40.589
You've done enough.

46:43.717 --> 46:45.677
Young Lady Heo gave me medicine
for my pain.

46:47.804 --> 46:48.972
I'll give some to you.

46:51.016 --> 46:53.185
Please take it… for me.

46:59.983 --> 47:01.735
[groaning softly]

47:05.030 --> 47:07.616
[Ho-gyeong] Since she's still alive
with the blood parasite

47:07.699 --> 47:11.245
in the core of her energy,
she must have a high tolerance for pain.

47:12.204 --> 47:13.038
However,

47:13.789 --> 47:17.000
if the blood parasite's energy
flows the wrong way,

47:17.751 --> 47:19.962
she is going to die from agony.

47:22.130 --> 47:24.132
She'll need my help if she wishes to live.

47:24.675 --> 47:27.928
She'll think twice
about revealing Bu-yeon's secret.

47:28.512 --> 47:31.181
But… is there a way to get rid of it

47:32.349 --> 47:33.725
once it reaches one's energy?

47:38.981 --> 47:40.399
Insects are always eaten by…

47:42.651 --> 47:43.485
birds.

47:49.908 --> 47:53.537
[Jin] It seems Jin Bu-yeon is
a more powerful priestess than I expected.

47:53.620 --> 47:55.622
She has started to regain
her divine powers?

47:55.706 --> 47:59.209
You said once she regained her memories,
her powers would return.

47:59.293 --> 48:00.127
I did not.

48:00.210 --> 48:02.713
Once she regains her powers,
her memories will return.

48:03.755 --> 48:04.881
Isn't that the same thing?

48:04.965 --> 48:05.924
[sighs]

48:06.425 --> 48:07.509
Have her continue looking.

48:17.185 --> 48:19.187
Once Jin Bu-yeon's powers return,

48:19.938 --> 48:22.149
the lost memories will return to Naksu,

48:22.941 --> 48:25.110
and she'll be driven from the body.

48:37.164 --> 48:39.666
See! I got a Songrim Spirit Plaque.

48:40.667 --> 48:43.503
I'm allowed to enter freely,
just like a Jeongjingak mage.

48:43.587 --> 48:45.922
Seeing you with that makes it seem like

48:46.006 --> 48:49.009
the effort I had to put in to get one
was a complete waste of time.

48:49.092 --> 48:50.385
It took a lot of effort?

48:51.219 --> 48:53.889
You are a bad student?
What was your class rank?

48:53.972 --> 48:58.143
I reached Chisu faster than anyone
once my gate of energy was finally opened.

48:58.727 --> 49:00.270
[Bu-yeon] You must have trained hard.

49:00.354 --> 49:01.855
That's because someone…

49:02.814 --> 49:05.484
put my life at risk
if I didn't do my very best.

49:05.567 --> 49:06.401
[Bu-yeon] Who?

49:07.944 --> 49:08.779
My…

49:11.198 --> 49:12.240
old master.

49:15.869 --> 49:19.956
My master was tough, always pushing me
to my limits, to the brink of death.

49:20.040 --> 49:20.999
Thanks to that,

49:21.833 --> 49:23.502
I always continued to improve myself.

49:24.419 --> 49:26.046
My master never allowed me

49:26.672 --> 49:28.006
to ever quit and do nothing.

49:29.508 --> 49:31.718
If you are not going to do anything,
you might as well die.

49:33.261 --> 49:36.056
[soft music playing]

49:36.932 --> 49:37.766
What?

49:38.934 --> 49:40.852
Are you confused again?

49:42.145 --> 49:44.481
I really have no idea
who's saying these things anymore.

49:48.068 --> 49:49.194
But it is strange.

49:49.277 --> 49:51.113
I've heard it multiple times today.

49:51.905 --> 49:53.115
Maybe because I wanted to quit.

49:53.198 --> 49:54.574
What do you mean?

49:55.200 --> 49:57.369
Were you planning
to give up on everything?

49:58.829 --> 49:59.663
Yeah.

50:01.123 --> 50:02.207
I thought that…

50:03.542 --> 50:05.711
I'd finally found a way
to get rid of this heavy burden.

50:08.797 --> 50:09.631
It's…

50:11.591 --> 50:12.884
really that hard for you?

50:21.059 --> 50:24.020
Lord Park told me I was incredible
when he gave this to me.

50:24.646 --> 50:26.648
I'll slowly regain more of my powers,

50:28.024 --> 50:29.276
and I'll use them…

50:32.279 --> 50:33.363
to protect you, okay?

50:35.115 --> 50:36.658
This also confuses me.

50:37.826 --> 50:38.744
About what it is…

50:40.537 --> 50:41.621
that I really want from you.

50:42.998 --> 50:43.832
I…

50:44.958 --> 50:46.042
plan to find my own room.

50:48.003 --> 50:51.298
I will try my best to find out
who I really am and decorate it well.

50:54.134 --> 50:54.968
So that…

50:57.304 --> 50:58.722
you don't get confused anymore.

50:58.805 --> 51:01.600
["Breath" by Kim Na Young playing]

51:10.650 --> 51:12.194
I will make it…

51:13.403 --> 51:14.780
a warm, comfortable place for you.

51:37.594 --> 51:39.888
I barely advanced the hearing for it

51:39.971 --> 51:42.265
and you threw everything I planned for
in the lake?

51:43.308 --> 51:45.352
I was afraid of getting caught,
so I had no choice.

51:45.435 --> 51:49.481
So-i will be in charge, once more,
of importing our goods into the capital.

51:51.691 --> 51:52.526
Bring her here.

51:53.026 --> 51:55.028
So-i has not been seen
for quite a while now.

51:55.111 --> 51:58.615
As long as the parasite is in her,
she cannot escape my control.

51:59.449 --> 52:00.659
Once she shows, bring her here.

52:01.618 --> 52:02.536
Yes.

52:11.044 --> 52:11.962
[Seo Yul] Show them this letter.

52:13.421 --> 52:14.589
They are going to take care of you.

52:15.549 --> 52:17.759
Young Master, when are you going
to visit Jin Ho-gyeong?

52:17.843 --> 52:19.135
You don't have time to waste.

52:19.928 --> 52:20.762
I know.

52:21.888 --> 52:22.973
Please come back alive.

52:24.599 --> 52:28.311
Once you feel better,
you'll also return to Seoho Fortress?

52:31.815 --> 52:32.941
[sighs]

52:33.024 --> 52:34.067
Please have a safe trip.

52:41.074 --> 52:43.743
[unsettling music playing]

52:58.049 --> 52:59.134
I'm trying to pick

53:00.135 --> 53:01.595
a lucky date for us.

53:02.512 --> 53:03.597
Let's get married then.

53:03.680 --> 53:04.764
Please.

53:06.099 --> 53:06.975
[exhales sharply]

53:07.893 --> 53:09.978
I'll also need to decide
for Young Master Jang.

53:11.313 --> 53:16.067
Let us invite every single person
in your family to our wedding.

53:17.152 --> 53:19.362
I'll send over a large boat for them.

53:19.446 --> 53:20.405
Thank you so much.

53:21.990 --> 53:24.200
Who should I invite
to Young Master Jang's wedding?

53:25.702 --> 53:28.079
He has no family
so I don't want him to feel empty.

53:29.998 --> 53:33.585
Maidservant Kim,
why are you peeling these?

53:33.668 --> 53:35.420
Young Master Jang loves chestnut rice.

53:38.089 --> 53:38.924
I'm hurt.

53:39.591 --> 53:41.134
Whatever we talk about,

53:42.385 --> 53:43.261
Uk comes first.

53:43.345 --> 53:46.640
Oh, well, he is my young master after all.

53:47.474 --> 53:49.017
And I worry about him a lot.

53:51.519 --> 53:52.604
[Jin] Here.

53:52.687 --> 53:55.273
If Uk and I were drowning
just like this here,

53:55.774 --> 53:57.484
who would you save first then?

53:57.567 --> 53:59.069
[scoffs, inhales deeply]

53:59.152 --> 54:03.406
I wouldn't need to save either of you
since both of you can swim very well.

54:03.490 --> 54:04.866
What if we could not though?

54:04.950 --> 54:07.827
And we were both floundering
in the water, grasping for air?

54:07.911 --> 54:11.164
Whose name do you think
you'd call first? Who?

54:13.375 --> 54:14.209
Well…

54:16.836 --> 54:18.254
- J-Ja--
- You'll…

54:18.338 --> 54:20.632
shout "Young Master!"

54:23.551 --> 54:25.470
You will save only Uk.

54:25.553 --> 54:26.513
You will not…

54:28.014 --> 54:29.432
care about Jin at all.

54:29.516 --> 54:31.476
Then what about you, my lord?
Did you not say

54:31.559 --> 54:34.229
that you would close the door
even if I were going to die inside?

54:34.312 --> 54:36.147
- When did I say that?
- For real!

54:37.440 --> 54:40.026
Fine, then,
let me ask you one more time, hmm?

54:40.944 --> 54:44.239
I am, uh, trapped inside
an extremely dangerous room,

54:45.031 --> 54:47.367
but you must absolutely
close the door, no matter what.

54:47.450 --> 54:51.955
In that case, would you just
close the door or not close it?

54:54.624 --> 54:57.544
But how urgent is the situation?

54:58.211 --> 54:59.629
If I don't close the door,

55:00.588 --> 55:03.717
- would the entire world be in danger?
- I knew it!

55:04.801 --> 55:06.553
You can't be that objective about it.

55:06.636 --> 55:08.638
I told you I'm in danger.

55:08.722 --> 55:10.557
Your betrothed will die.

55:10.640 --> 55:13.435
Please, do not concoct
such a heartbreaking scenario.

55:14.602 --> 55:15.603
You will…

55:16.271 --> 55:17.772
never be in danger

55:18.940 --> 55:20.233
with me, ever.

55:21.943 --> 55:22.777
[chuckles]

55:23.361 --> 55:25.780
Even if you do decide
to close that door, my lord,

55:26.781 --> 55:30.118
I know just how heartbreaking
it will be for you,

55:31.077 --> 55:32.537
so it doesn't upset me much.

55:33.955 --> 55:37.167
So, if I call "Uk" at first,

55:38.084 --> 55:40.045
know that it is not because…

55:40.545 --> 55:43.339
my affection for my darling Jin
is in any way smaller.

55:44.716 --> 55:45.884
I was foolish.

55:46.468 --> 55:47.469
My question…

55:48.261 --> 55:53.266
posed such a terrible choice where someone
who you love so much would have to die.

55:56.311 --> 55:57.145
[Jin] Both should be saved.

55:58.730 --> 56:01.149
At all costs, both should be saved.

56:06.196 --> 56:08.948
Well, neither of you will ever drown.

56:15.747 --> 56:17.957
[somber music playing]

56:38.019 --> 56:40.980
[Seo Yul] Tear it out and crush the heart.

56:41.981 --> 56:44.275
[Dang-gu]
So you wish to go to Danhyanggok?

56:45.193 --> 56:46.111
Wh-Why there?

56:46.194 --> 56:50.281
I heard about a gigantic tree there,
and I really want to see it for myself.

56:50.365 --> 56:52.367
It's true that there's a tree.

56:53.368 --> 56:54.869
I went with Uk and Yul.

56:56.996 --> 56:58.623
We've seen the tree together.

56:58.706 --> 57:01.042
The tree that I wish to see
is actually my tree.

57:01.126 --> 57:02.252
Huh?

57:03.461 --> 57:05.421
I remember a very big tree there,

57:06.131 --> 57:07.340
and I wish to see it…

57:08.842 --> 57:09.926
if it really exists.

57:10.677 --> 57:11.511
Uh…

57:12.011 --> 57:16.391
I'm not sure we're talking
about the same tree, but it's really tall.

57:16.891 --> 57:17.934
It will be easy for you to find.

57:18.726 --> 57:22.313
I would love to escort you there myself,
but I'm busy.

57:22.397 --> 57:24.941
Shall I have
someone guide you to Danhyanggok?

57:25.024 --> 57:27.026
[Bu-yeon] I will ask
if I need someone to do so.

57:27.110 --> 57:28.695
[Seo Yul] Are you going to Danhyanggok?

57:29.571 --> 57:31.072
[gasps]
Oh, good!

57:31.156 --> 57:33.158
Yul knows his way around there
better than me.

57:33.700 --> 57:35.201
[Dang-gu]
He went there a lot when he was young.

57:35.285 --> 57:36.786
I also wanted to go there.

57:37.745 --> 57:38.955
Shall we go?

57:39.038 --> 57:42.083
Oh, great, Yul can take you there.
You can go together.

57:42.667 --> 57:43.877
I heard it's dangerous though.

57:45.086 --> 57:46.045
Is that fine, Yul?

57:46.629 --> 57:47.464
Yes.

57:48.882 --> 57:50.133
Let's go there together.

57:56.139 --> 57:57.724
THE FIRE BIRD

58:01.603 --> 58:03.146
It looks like these people

58:03.813 --> 58:06.191
are trying to do the same thing
by waking the bird.

58:06.274 --> 58:09.152
You wouldn't do anything
despite knowing how dangerous it is?

58:11.738 --> 58:14.073
If you are not going to do anything,
you might as well die.

58:37.013 --> 58:38.890
[Bu-yeon]
I promise you I don't have that stone!

58:39.474 --> 58:41.267
If she really doesn't carry it with her…

58:43.102 --> 58:44.521
it must be somewhere in here.

58:55.156 --> 58:56.157
What?

58:57.242 --> 58:58.451
You've come awfully quick, Jang Uk.

59:00.828 --> 59:02.914
What? You can't sleep again?

59:02.997 --> 59:04.040
Do you want me to hold you?

59:04.123 --> 59:05.583
How will that help me sleep though?

59:06.167 --> 59:08.294
Look, I just came here to check something…

59:09.337 --> 59:11.839
if you have the yin-yang jade in here.

59:12.423 --> 59:13.258
[scoffs]

59:20.974 --> 59:22.642
See. I keep it here.

59:25.353 --> 59:26.437
So what you said…

59:27.564 --> 59:28.856
was really your memories then?

59:30.275 --> 59:31.276
It is strange.

59:32.694 --> 59:34.487
That's why
I'm going to Danhyanggok tomorrow.

59:34.571 --> 59:35.780
Danhyanggok?

59:35.863 --> 59:36.781
I want to see the tree.

59:37.907 --> 59:39.701
You told me
that the tree was there, right?

59:41.869 --> 59:45.582
I want to see it for myself
if it actually exists.

59:46.833 --> 59:48.835
My memories are confused because of it.

59:49.419 --> 59:51.671
But I know one thing, that tree…

59:52.589 --> 59:54.632
was in my mind long before I even met you.

59:57.427 --> 01:00:00.513
If I see it, I'm sure
it'll help me figure things out.

01:00:01.097 --> 01:00:02.223
[smacks lips]

01:00:02.307 --> 01:00:04.017
Okay, then go see yourself.

01:00:04.100 --> 01:00:04.934
- I will--
- Actually, Yul and I are going

01:00:05.018 --> 01:00:05.977
together tomorrow.

01:00:08.187 --> 01:00:09.564
- With Yul?
- I said I wanted to go

01:00:09.647 --> 01:00:11.608
and then he said that he'd come too.

01:00:13.318 --> 01:00:15.069
Hey, why would you bother him?

01:00:15.153 --> 01:00:16.946
He said he wanted
to go to Danhyanggok too.

01:00:17.030 --> 01:00:20.366
He is my friend. He couldn't refuse
to help you only because of me.

01:00:20.450 --> 01:00:22.910
- He's my friend as well.
- He's my friend.

01:00:22.994 --> 01:00:24.329
So you can't be his friend!

01:00:24.412 --> 01:00:26.122
- Why not?
- Yul is my friend.

01:00:26.205 --> 01:00:28.124
If he's your friend, then we are friends.

01:00:28.207 --> 01:00:29.083
Can we not even be friends?

01:00:29.167 --> 01:00:31.127
How can you be a friend
if you hold me at night?

01:00:34.255 --> 01:00:36.257
[soft music playing]

01:00:54.817 --> 01:00:55.652
Have fun…

01:00:57.278 --> 01:00:59.030
at Danhyanggok with your friend tomorrow.

01:01:03.076 --> 01:01:04.702
I mean it's cool if you two are friends.

01:01:16.297 --> 01:01:17.173
[sighs]

01:01:20.259 --> 01:01:21.177
You've lost it, Uk.

01:01:22.804 --> 01:01:24.222
[sighs]

01:01:35.441 --> 01:01:37.068
[Bu-yeon] So this is Danhyanggok.

01:01:37.735 --> 01:01:39.028
What a nice view!

01:01:42.031 --> 01:01:44.701
Did you say you came here before?

01:01:45.660 --> 01:01:47.036
- Right.
- Hmm.

01:01:48.246 --> 01:01:49.914
This is the place where we first met.

01:01:49.997 --> 01:01:52.709
So did we meet a long time ago?

01:01:56.295 --> 01:01:57.797
I used to come here to visit you.

01:02:01.217 --> 01:02:03.094
I didn't let my broken leg stop me.

01:02:04.429 --> 01:02:06.305
I wasn't afraid to get scolded either…

01:02:12.145 --> 01:02:13.646
because I liked you so much.

01:02:15.982 --> 01:02:17.692
[Seo Yul] I couldn't help what I felt.

01:02:19.610 --> 01:02:21.404
Despite knowing who you were,
I did nothing,

01:02:21.487 --> 01:02:23.406
and lived my life full of regrets.

01:02:26.159 --> 01:02:28.119
I'm glad I noticed you first, this time.

01:02:30.413 --> 01:02:32.081
I can do what I should have.

01:02:43.384 --> 01:02:45.386
[dramatic music playing]

01:02:50.183 --> 01:02:51.893
[breathes shakily]

01:02:58.524 --> 01:03:01.235
[doctor Seo]
Young Master. Young Master Seo.

01:03:04.822 --> 01:03:06.532
What were you just thinking about?

01:03:07.116 --> 01:03:09.243
Master Heo wishes to see you right now.

01:03:15.082 --> 01:03:16.417
I heard from my granddaughter

01:03:16.501 --> 01:03:18.920
that you helped hide So-i.

01:03:19.003 --> 01:03:20.213
She's already gone.

01:03:20.755 --> 01:03:22.465
I sent her far away, so do not worry.

01:03:23.674 --> 01:03:24.509
Then why…

01:03:25.218 --> 01:03:27.220
are you avoiding me?

01:03:27.720 --> 01:03:32.225
Do you still resent me
for dragging you back home to Seoho?

01:03:32.809 --> 01:03:34.435
You're the last of the Seo line

01:03:34.519 --> 01:03:37.563
and I did not want you involved
with Naksu either.

01:03:37.647 --> 01:03:38.773
I know all that.

01:03:44.153 --> 01:03:45.905
Oh, you don't look well at all, Yul.

01:03:46.489 --> 01:03:48.658
Let me examine you. Come!

01:03:48.741 --> 01:03:51.410
I need to go
somewhere right now. I'll come…

01:03:55.915 --> 01:03:56.833
once I return.

01:03:56.916 --> 01:03:58.417
Yeah, okay.

01:03:59.836 --> 01:04:02.004
If you don't, I will go and get you.

01:04:03.214 --> 01:04:04.048
Yeah.

01:04:05.591 --> 01:04:06.801
I'm so sorry, Master.

01:04:08.636 --> 01:04:09.554
I really wish you well.

01:04:19.272 --> 01:04:24.068
Madam, what made you so concerned
that you had to return?

01:04:24.151 --> 01:04:27.154
I promise that we will leave
as soon as I see him go to Jinyowon.

01:04:27.238 --> 01:04:29.824
Why do you care so much about him?

01:04:31.951 --> 01:04:33.619
You like him?
[chuckles]

01:04:35.162 --> 01:04:36.038
[chuckles]

01:04:39.041 --> 01:04:40.585
The only world I knew…

01:04:42.461 --> 01:04:44.130
was always so filthy and dark.

01:04:46.549 --> 01:04:48.759
Back when I was swindling people,

01:04:50.595 --> 01:04:51.971
I met the Young Master.

01:04:55.266 --> 01:04:57.018
After that, everything…

01:04:59.854 --> 01:05:01.105
was so much cleaner…

01:05:04.066 --> 01:05:05.109
and much brighter.

01:05:05.192 --> 01:05:06.444
- [So-i screams]
- [thug grunts]

01:05:07.278 --> 01:05:09.280
[wistful music playing]

01:05:23.252 --> 01:05:24.086
That's…

01:05:25.421 --> 01:05:26.422
just how I felt.

01:05:26.505 --> 01:05:28.341
Well, let's check.

01:05:29.967 --> 01:05:31.344
I'll go buy us food first.

01:05:37.725 --> 01:05:40.019
[breathes shakily]

01:05:57.370 --> 01:06:01.040
I see you all have taken over
since I stepped out for a bit.

01:06:01.123 --> 01:06:03.793
[suspenseful music playing]

01:06:14.637 --> 01:06:17.515
[Yeom-su] You… were trying to run.

01:06:18.182 --> 01:06:21.519
You couldn't possibly think of doing that
with the blood parasite in you.

01:06:22.103 --> 01:06:24.480
So then, you figured out
how to take it out?

01:06:27.733 --> 01:06:30.152
[suspenseful music continues playing]

01:06:31.320 --> 01:06:33.114
[grunts, groans]

01:06:37.284 --> 01:06:39.495
[Yeom-su] Tell me the truth
if you don't want to die.

01:06:40.121 --> 01:06:41.914
Did you really take the parasite out?

01:06:49.797 --> 01:06:51.132
[Bu-yeon] Maidservant Kim made us lunch.

01:06:51.966 --> 01:06:53.676
[sighs]
What beautiful weather!

01:06:54.593 --> 01:06:55.845
This feels like a picnic.

01:06:57.763 --> 01:06:59.140
Did you get to say goodbye to Uk?

01:06:59.849 --> 01:07:02.560
I did. He told me
to have fun with your friend.

01:07:04.729 --> 01:07:05.563
Right.

01:07:06.480 --> 01:07:07.481
Are you not…

01:07:08.816 --> 01:07:10.067
still sick?

01:07:10.151 --> 01:07:12.236
I did what you said and didn't tell Uk.

01:07:16.991 --> 01:07:18.034
I'm sorry.

01:07:19.785 --> 01:07:20.745
[Yong-pil] Young Master!

01:07:23.914 --> 01:07:24.999
[Seo Yul] What's going on?

01:07:25.624 --> 01:07:27.209
- You should have left now.
- [Yong-pil] Back there…

01:07:27.293 --> 01:07:29.336
Madam So-i has been captured
by Cheonbugwan right now.

01:07:30.588 --> 01:07:31.797
What's a blood parasite?

01:07:32.506 --> 01:07:34.717
They are beating her,
saying she no longer has it.

01:07:36.052 --> 01:07:37.428
Is she being held at that gambling den?

01:07:37.511 --> 01:07:38.345
Yeah.

01:07:39.472 --> 01:07:41.307
[tense music playing]

01:07:45.102 --> 01:07:46.937
Who has the parasite now?

01:07:47.021 --> 01:07:48.606
Who did you give the medicine to?

01:07:48.689 --> 01:07:51.859
[shouts]
I took the medicine!

01:07:53.944 --> 01:07:56.030
I thought it was good for me.

01:07:58.199 --> 01:07:59.325
Tell me the truth now,

01:08:00.034 --> 01:08:02.411
or Gwanju will soon crush you
to little pieces.

01:08:10.795 --> 01:08:11.837
Put it down!

01:08:11.921 --> 01:08:14.548
[shouts]
Put it back! Put it down!

01:08:15.049 --> 01:08:17.468
Put it back! Put that down!

01:08:19.011 --> 01:08:20.054
Put that down!

01:08:20.137 --> 01:08:22.598
[shouts]
No! No! Put it back!

01:08:30.648 --> 01:08:32.691
[Jang Uk] A blood parasite? What is that?

01:08:33.234 --> 01:08:34.610
I'm not sure either.

01:08:35.653 --> 01:08:36.862
But that's what I heard.

01:08:38.781 --> 01:08:40.866
[Bu-yeon]
There's something I haven't told you yet.

01:08:44.453 --> 01:08:46.080
He told me not to tell you but…

01:08:50.334 --> 01:08:51.168
[inhales sharply]

01:08:51.710 --> 01:08:52.962
…Seo Yul is very ill.

01:08:56.090 --> 01:08:58.384
[Bu-yeon]
I saw a strange energy inside him.

01:08:59.176 --> 01:09:01.595
I think it's the blood parasite.

01:09:09.645 --> 01:09:11.647
Take everything
So-i took from Cheonbugwan.

01:09:11.730 --> 01:09:12.731
- Yes.
- Yes.

01:09:17.111 --> 01:09:19.113
[dramatic music playing]

01:09:45.931 --> 01:09:48.434
Seo Yul. So, are you the person
she was trying to hide?

01:09:48.517 --> 01:09:50.686
She's coming with me. Move aside.

01:09:52.146 --> 01:09:54.273
[Yeom-su] So-i knows
too many secrets of the Gwanju.

01:09:54.815 --> 01:09:56.901
If Songrim takes her, I'm done for.

01:09:56.984 --> 01:09:57.902
She's staying.

01:09:58.485 --> 01:10:00.070
[Yeom-su] Cheonbugwan is looking for her.

01:10:04.366 --> 01:10:05.242
I said move now!

01:10:05.326 --> 01:10:08.537
- Why would a man like you protect such--
- I cannot allow you

01:10:09.496 --> 01:10:11.290
to just take So-i back to Jin Mu.

01:10:14.585 --> 01:10:16.128
[mages shout]

01:10:19.173 --> 01:10:20.633
[all grunting]

01:10:31.810 --> 01:10:33.437
[Seo Yul gasps]
I must end it quickly.

01:10:34.104 --> 01:10:35.981
It's dangerous to use
too much of my energy.

01:10:40.236 --> 01:10:42.780
[gasps, breathes heavily]

01:10:44.573 --> 01:10:45.449
The parasite?

01:10:48.702 --> 01:10:49.995
[Yeom-su] So So-i's parasite…

01:10:51.205 --> 01:10:52.706
is inside Seo Yul's body.

01:10:53.374 --> 01:10:54.583
[scoffs]

01:10:58.462 --> 01:11:00.130
[tense music playing]

01:11:00.881 --> 01:11:02.299
[Seo Yul grunts softly]

01:11:07.429 --> 01:11:08.555
- [So-i screams]
- [Yeom-su grunts]

01:11:45.092 --> 01:11:45.968
[shouts]

01:11:58.647 --> 01:11:59.481
So-i.

01:12:03.402 --> 01:12:05.404
[somber music playing]

01:12:11.160 --> 01:12:13.704
[So-i] I am glad
that the world I get to see…

01:12:15.414 --> 01:12:16.749
before I die…

01:12:18.834 --> 01:12:20.461
was a clean…

01:12:21.962 --> 01:12:23.005
[So-i sobs]

01:12:23.505 --> 01:12:24.673
…and bright one.

01:12:29.887 --> 01:12:30.804
Please…

01:12:32.973 --> 01:12:34.266
continue living.

01:12:37.061 --> 01:12:39.021
[Seo Yul breathes shakily]

01:12:44.568 --> 01:12:46.570
[somber music continues playing]

01:13:00.042 --> 01:13:03.712
I don't know how a nobleman
got involved with the likes of her.

01:13:04.588 --> 01:13:06.340
But now that things have come to this,

01:13:06.924 --> 01:13:08.217
I can't let you leave alive.

01:13:09.218 --> 01:13:11.220
[sobs, breathes heavily]

01:13:29.154 --> 01:13:30.239
[mage shouts]

01:13:46.797 --> 01:13:48.465
[breathes shakily]

01:13:54.012 --> 01:13:56.014
[ominous music playing]

01:14:04.398 --> 01:14:06.150
[chuckles softly]

01:14:28.630 --> 01:14:30.632
[epic music playing]

01:14:53.780 --> 01:14:54.615
Yul.

01:14:56.366 --> 01:14:57.242
Yul.

01:14:59.411 --> 01:15:01.371
Uk.
[breathes shakily]

01:15:03.457 --> 01:15:04.416
[Seo Yul] I'm sorry.

01:15:21.892 --> 01:15:23.894
[dramatic music playing]

01:15:38.617 --> 01:15:40.244
Not a single person here…

01:15:42.204 --> 01:15:43.830
will leave this place alive.

01:15:47.209 --> 01:15:49.211
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the Garden playing]

01:16:08.647 --> 01:16:11.567
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:16:12.150 --> 01:16:13.569
[Jang Uk] Who put it in So-i's body?

01:16:14.111 --> 01:16:15.445
Jin Mu?

01:16:16.405 --> 01:16:18.574
Jang Uk is not to enter Cheonbugwan,
you hear me?

01:16:21.118 --> 01:16:22.703
[Sun]
If Seo Yul really dies because of this,

01:16:22.786 --> 01:16:25.831
Songrim and Cheonbugwan
will break out into a clash.

01:16:27.040 --> 01:16:30.002
She said she didn't want to know,
so I plan to reveal it.

01:16:31.128 --> 01:16:32.713
[Seo Yul] You can have three breaths.

01:16:32.796 --> 01:16:35.507
[Yun-ok] You said you don't remember
who you are, right?

01:16:35.591 --> 01:16:39.386
Yes, because her blue marks
blossomed like flowers in her eyes.
